            "review_text": "JLuiHK\nHong Kong, China4 contributions\n0\nService to be improved\nMay 2015 • Family\nI had visited twice during my stay in Ho Chi Minh. Admittedly the food was good for price. They also offer a pretty good range of choices. However the service was not that satisfactory. Staff was not responding when I raised my hand and asked for help. Certain behaviors made me feel uncomfortable but I am not going to specify them here. It was understood that staff there might only be capable of communicating in very limited English. Honestly I did not expect much from an economical restaurant but it could have deserved more if better service was provided.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 3, 2015",
