            "review_text": "GlobalEater\nLondon England654 contributions\n0\nGood food at great prices\nApr 2015 • Couples\nWe visited here to try some local street food and found the food to be very good and the prices to be ridiculously cheap.\n\nIt looks very nice inside and although we did see a cockroach moving under the table it is Asia and the climate does tend to make this happen, this is not always a sign of lack of cleanliness so you should not be put off by this.\n\nWe enjoyed our meal and would go back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 6, 2015",
