            "review_text": "K-slo86\n4 contributions\n0\nWorst meal in 2 weeks in Vietnam\nApr 2015 • Friends\nJust ate at this restaurant and really don't understand how other reviewers have given it 5 stars. We travelled Vietnam for 2 weeks and we eat lots of street food which was all incredible - this was not. It was the only bad meal we had in 2 weeks and it was really bad. The meat in the summer rolls was just fat and gristle - so was inedible. The hot pot was overpriced. And the staff were probably the least friendly we came across in Vietnam. Do your self a favour and don't eat here.\nRead more\nWritten April 15, 2015",
